        fill: "#BAE6FD", stroke: "#0369A1",
        description: "A short synthetic DNA sequence that binds to the target DNA strand and provides a starting point for DNA polymerase.",
        function: "Marks the exact region of DNA that will be copied during each PCR cycle.",
